    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "My name is Lucas. I’ve lived in Sheffield since I was a child. Now I work full-time as a nurse at a local hospital. But I have always been interested in art and history. I enjoy visiting art museums and historic sites. I also like to express myself through artworks and photos. As a young child, my dream was to work in an art museum. I have never forgotten it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "For a few years, I had been thinking about volunteering at the Sheffield Museum. Last summer, I decided to go for it. I got in touch with the museum through its website. A few days later, the museum called me. On July 10, I started doing some two-hour "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "shifts",
            "zh": "轮班"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " twice a week. My duties were to support the Visitor Experience team in welcoming visitors and completing surveys. In November, I joined the “Talking Tables” project. On the “Talking Tables”, there are some selected items. Visitors can touch them and ask questions. My job is to look after these items."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In December, I attended a seasonal celebration for volunteers at the Sheffield Museum. It was a lovely event with a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "buffet",
            "zh": "自助餐"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". History professor Stephen Nissenbaum delivered a lecture on mid-winter traditions around the world."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I have found the museum staff and the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "fellow",
            "zh": "同事的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " volunteers to be very friendly. I have felt respected and valued. It has been enjoyable to feel useful in a completely different role and working environment from those of my regular job."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
